          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Expert Diagnosis",
            "text": "<p>Based on your dog's history, breed and behavior, we will assess the root of the problem (s) to ensure you fully understand your dog and how to improve their mental and physical state. </p>",
